This directory includes wpa-supplicant recipe and files from Comcores MACsec SW release.

Comcores creates its own recipe for wpa-supplicant (instead of appending the original recipe in poky).

Unfortunately we have to follow this practice to avoid merging conflicts with Comcores future releases.

We will not modify recipes/files as long as possible for the same reason.

Comcores release process: Comcores will notify ADI, ADI engineers will pull the release files from Comcores server.

Current release version: 13.001
